    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2518320/extras/005995631cbff25da2b2bb40ea02656c.poster.avif?t=1754034082\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2518320/extras/005995631cbff25da2b2bb40ea02656c.webm?t=1754034082\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2518320/extras/005995631cbff25da2b2bb40ea02656c.mp4?t=1754034082\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dead Underworld</strong> is a <strong><i>single-player, dungeon-diving, turn-based roguelike</i></strong> set in a fantastical realm of eternal conflict. Gather resources and strengthen your party to endure a harsh world brimming with dangers. Engage in swift, punishing battles where every decision counts. Should a party member fall, recruit a new fellow Seeker to continue your quest. Who among you will escape the Underworld?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2518320/extras/5bea7d063b941a16f942a984b1c32c68.poster.avif?t=1754034082\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2518320/extras/5bea7d063b941a16f942a984b1c32c68.webm?t=1754034082\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2518320/extras/5bea7d063b941a16f942a984b1c32c68.mp4?t=1754034082\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2518320/extras/e322017cf9e23c1c25b680692d95d278.webp?t=1754034082\" /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Choose your path and explore a procedurally generated world.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gather items and resources to aid your survival.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Journey through diverse environments.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Avoid environmental hazards such as shifting radiation clouds and ancient guard towers.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Investigate haunted shrines and broken machines to uncover the world\u2019s secrets.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gain the favor of one of the three major factions to survive until the end. </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2518320/extras/cf555bf52f8b4b46d1527a538116a194.poster.avif?t=1754034082\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2518320/extras/cf555bf52f8b4b46d1527a538116a194.webm?t=1754034082\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2518320/extras/cf555bf52f8b4b46d1527a538116a194.mp4?t=1754034082\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2518320/extras/f066a2efc327d247df52a67db986ca03.webp?t=1754034082\" /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Travel alone or ally with another traveler.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Improve your characters' skills, perks, and weapons.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gain or lose traits based on your characters' actions.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock buffs that affect the whole party</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Survive to the end\u2014dead characters stay dead.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2518320/extras/881e7f8e19f0c74cbd89c51802e71a79.poster.avif?t=1754034082\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2518320/extras/881e7f8e19f0c74cbd89c51802e71a79.webm?t=1754034082\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2518320/extras/881e7f8e19f0c74cbd89c51802e71a79.mp4?t=1754034082\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2518320/extras/298099844831bdc9e3b7035ff395a66a.webp?t=1754034082\" /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Engage in punishing turn-based battles against relentless enemies.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose your weapons and tactics wisely to claim victory.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Adapt to shifting combat ranges, status effects, and luck to prevail.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Equip your characters with weapons and items from hundreds of available options.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2518320/extras/ae9058e2b9f38b61bd17064d8f1bff62.poster.avif?t=1754034082\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2518320/extras/ae9058e2b9f38b61bd17064d8f1bff62.webm?t=1754034082\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2518320/extras/ae9058e2b9f38b61bd17064d8f1bff62.mp4?t=1754034082\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
