the end\u2014dead characters stay dead.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2518320/extras/881e7f8e19f0c74cbd89c51802e71a79.poster.avif?t=1754034082\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2518320/extras/881e7f8e19f0c74cbd89c51802e71a79.webm?t=1754034082\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2518320/extras/881e7f8e19f0c74cbd89c51802e71a79.mp4?t=1754034082\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2518320/extras/298099844831bdc9e3b7035ff395a66a.webp?t=1754034082\" /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Engage in punishing turn-based battles against relentless enemies.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose your weapons and tactics wisely to claim victory.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Adapt to shifting combat ranges, status effects, and luck to prevail.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Equip your characters with weapons and items from hundreds of available options.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2518320/extras/ae9058e2b9f38b61bd17064d8f1bff62.poster.avif?t=1754034082\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2518320/extras/ae9058e2b9f38b61bd17064d8f1bff62.webm?t=1754034082\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2518320/extras/ae9058e2b9f38b61bd17064d8f1bff